<!--
  Pilot Assist's HUD indicator for the titles whose discs author none (Pulse and
  Pure). This project's own layout, in the dialect the HUD reader parses, at the
  entry name Wipeout HD and 2048 use for theirs. Authored in the PSP's 480x272
  grid; a source on another grid has it scaled.

  CHOSEN, NOT MEASURED. The names and the show/blink rules follow HD's
  (`Hud_UpdateAssistIndicator`); the placement (a plate low in the centre, the two
  arrows beside the icon, the two big arrows at the screen's sides) is read off
  HD's own layout proportions and adapted by eye to Pulse's HUD, not read off
  anything Pulse authors. The art is geometry drawn by
  scripts/gen-fallback-assist-art.py.
-->
